      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c8fecbe8eaad6654ed5c4a8"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "The Far Lookers have been removed but this is a matter that will have to be referred to the Concordat's courts.\n\nNow as to your involvement in the whole matter... the TDF isn't pleased to the extent of the damage inflicted.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "And we weren't pleased to the unexpected opposition we faced.",
          "conditions": null,
