      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c095980935557a6ff69fda8"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "You received enough information to perform your task, mercenary. \n\nWe couldn't anticipate that the Far Lookers would have been so far ahead in their recruitment and training.",
